  "article": [
    { "en": "At the time the murder was committed, I was travelling on the 8 o'clock train to London.", "zh": "谋杀发生时，我正乘坐8点钟开往伦敦的火车。" },
    { "en": "'Do you always catch such an early train?' the inspector asked the man.", "zh": "“你总是乘这样早的火车吗？”探长问那人。" },
    { "en": "I must be at work at 10 o'clock, and my employer will confirm that I was there on time.", "zh": "我10点钟必须上班，我的雇主会证实我当时准时到岗。" },
    { "en": "'Would a later train get you to work on time?' the inspector asked again.", "zh": "“晚一点的火车也能让你准时上班吗？”探长又问。" },
    { "en": "The man replied that he supposed it would, but he never caught a later train.", "zh": "那人回答说他想是这样，但他从不乘晚班火车。" },
    { "en": "Then the inspector asked him at what time he had arrived at the station.", "zh": "接着探长问他是什么时候到达火车站的。" },
    { "en": "The man told him he had arrived at ten to eight, bought a paper, and waited for the train.", "zh": "那人告诉探长，他7点50分到达，买了一份报纸，然后等火车。" },
    { "en": "The inspector asked the man whether he had noticed anything unusual.", "zh": "探长问那人是否注意到什么不寻常的情况。" },
    { "en": "'Of course not,' the man replied.", "zh": "“当然没有。”那人回答。" }
  ]
